  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1137618/description_d3ee7702-a8f1-4a84-bfed-e2e42cb49c36.png\" width=\"598\" height=\"298\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px;color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>Fel's Machine Guns II</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px;color:#7e8c8d\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/t5UxRGwwFE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ik4uwXR.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"59\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmeowratic_works\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1449577/description_edcf5c90-2e02-40c8-a38f-a11f7fca4c8c.png\" width=\"198\" height=\"98\"></a></strong></span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px;color:#7e8c8d\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1137618/description_6e171673-4648-4c3e-99ca-1dc4fd3d4173.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"160\" height=\"54\"></a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">本模組為您的《我的世界》遊戲新增多種重型機槍，協助您防禦基地。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">注意：本模組為基礎版本，若要獲得更多內容，必須安裝擴充套件。我採用此設計方式以維持與 1.20.1 的相容性。</span></strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px;color:#95a5a6\">擴充套件列表：</span></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fmgii-german-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">FMGII:German Pack</span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>模組功能：</strong></span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">沉浸式射擊與瞄準體驗。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">進階動畫換彈機制。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">輕量級模組。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">支援 1.20.1 與 1.21.1 版本</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">感謝大家突破 10 萬次下載！</span></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1613/20/imagen_2026-04-03_174723876-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"291\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1F0l9ZuFa94\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h6>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FCLWGJ5ffMY?t=749s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">快速使用指南：&nbsp;（舊版）</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1- 將正確的彈鏈裝入，按住 Shift 鍵左鍵點擊機槍以打開彈匣，接著不按 Shift 再次右鍵點擊該槍，即可架設機槍，隨後按下 B 鍵扣下扳機，準備開火。</p>\n<p>2- 具備手動仰角調整功能的武器，請按鍵盤上、下方向鍵進行校準。</p>\n<p>3- 別忘了設定射擊按鍵的鍵位，因為預設為未啟用狀態（不知為何無法預設設定滑鼠按鍵，總之我之後會嘗試修復）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px;color:#7e8c8d\">注意：本模組運行需依賴 Gecko Lib 與 Iguana Lib。</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>歡迎在 Discord 上建議更多槍械或回報問題。</strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FelinaMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如果您願意，也可以在 Ko-fi 上支持我 :3</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3254\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1137618/description_7614426a-2473-41e9-aeb8-19141fd07ab5.png\" alt=\"https://rocketnode.com/felina\" width=\"1096\" height=\"105\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>",
